{"id":"wb-6-654","name":"开封东大寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开封东大寺","text":"开封东大寺位于河南开封市顺河回族区清平南街路西，是开封最为著名的清真寺，位列开封清真十三坊之首。2006年6月25日，作为清代古建筑被国家文物局公布为全国重点文物保护单位。\n该寺现存建筑为三进院落结构，包括照壁、门前石狮、大门、二门、廊房、配殿、卷棚大殿、讲堂、水房等建筑。寺对面有一附属清真女寺。\n该寺为河南省内规模较大的清真寺，历史上曾被称为河南首坊。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%81%E4%B8%9C%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":87871635,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87871635","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b8695f968fdf1bd9a6dd43a3.jpg","title":"20250622_Kaifeng_East_Mosque_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250622_Kaifeng_East_Mosque_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/20250622_Kaifeng_East_Mosque_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​开封东大寺","width":320,"height":213}}